id: aggressive-taunt
name: Aggressive Taunt
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score of 8+
tpCost: 10
# "If you have dealt Damage to an Opponent with 2+ Attacking Maneuvers on your turn, lower the Action Cost of this Unique
# Ability to 1 until the end of your turn." The attacks that dealt Damage on your turn are counted as the Damage lands
# (chat.mjs applyAttackDamage); at two, Finish Sign costs 1 Action this turn (use-maneuver.mjs).
taunts: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Two of your Attacking Maneuvers dealt Damage this turn: Finish Sign costs 1 Action for the rest of it.
text: >
  Aggressive Taunt: You’ve learned to blend aggression into your cockiness, shoving your superiority into your
  Opponent’s face while they’re still reeling from your assault.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 8+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: If you have dealt Damage to an Opponent with 2+ Attacking Maneuvers on your turn, lower the Action Cost of
  this Unique Ability to 1 until the end of your turn.
